What this tool does and does not grant
--------------------------------------

forksync drives the GitHub CLI (`gh`) against repositories you already have
access to. It creates no account, sends no message, and opens no pull request
by itself. Using it against a repository you do not own requires the
permissions `gh` already holds; nothing here grants access you did not
already have.
